 Z←W ReportStars Sky;BV;BNAMES;BCOORD;NB;I;ALT;AZ;MX;MY;ENTRY;LINE;ELEN;NCOLS;AAE
⍝ Bright visible star legend matching book example, for width W
⍝ Format: NAME ALT AZ  x  y — packed across full width
 Z←0⍴⊂''
 BV←Data.BRIGHT∧Sky.StarsVisible
 NB←+/BV
 :If NB=0 ⋄ :Return ⋄ :EndIf
 BNAMES←BV/Data.STARNAMES
 BCOORD←(Sky.StarsVisible/Data.BRIGHT)⌿Sky.StarCoord
 AAE←Sky.BrightStarsAA
 ⍝ Fixed-width entry: 10 name + 4 alt + 5 az + 6 x + 6 y = 31 chars
 ELEN←31
 NCOLS←1⌈⌊W÷ELEN
 Z,←⊂''
 LINE←''
 :For I :In ⍳NB
   ALT←⌊0.5+AAE[I;1]
   AZ←⌊0.5+AAE[I;2]
   MX←0.01×⌊0.5+100×BCOORD[I;1]
   MY←0.01×⌊0.5+100×BCOORD[I;2]
   ENTRY←(¯10↑⊃BNAMES[I]),(¯4↑⍕ALT),(¯5↑⍕AZ),(¯7↑⍕MX),(¯6↑⍕MY)
   LINE←LINE,ENTRY
   :If 0=NCOLS|I
     Z,←⊂LINE
     LINE←''
   :EndIf
 :EndFor
 :If 0<≢LINE
   Z,←⊂LINE
 :EndIf
